  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I resume my account inside a house cut off by black smoke.",
      "shot": 0,
      "at": 0.25,
      "seconds": 4.98
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Anxiety for my wife drove me through every room, then toward solitude.",
      "shot": 1,
      "at": 7.458,
      "seconds": 5.46
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The smoke reached the road and changed waiting into a calculation.",
      "shot": 2,
      "at": 15.125,
      "seconds": 4.34
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The curate repeated his safety, while I prepared for the open road.",
      "shot": 3,
      "at": 21.667,
      "seconds": 4.46
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "curate",
      "text": "We are safe here.",
      "shot": 4,
      "at": 29.333,
      "seconds": 1.79
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I gathered food, drink, oil, rags, a hat, and a shirt.",
      "shot": 5,
      "at": 34.333,
      "seconds": 5.26
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Our road crossed ash, wreckage, fire, green grass, and bewildered survivors.",
      "shot": 6,
      "at": 43.167,
      "seconds": 6.4
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Under Richmond Bridge, red masses floated down the stream, some many feet across.",
      "shot": 7,
      "at": 51.583,
      "seconds": 5.75
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Three people ran toward the river, and up the hill Richmond burned.",
      "shot": 8,
      "at": 59.833,
      "seconds": 4.96
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Near Kew, a machine rose above the roofs and erased our route.",
      "shot": 9,
      "at": 67.333,
      "seconds": 4.89
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "We watched the machine seize its quarry, revealing purpose beyond destruction.",
      "shot": 10,
      "at": 75.417,
      "seconds": 5.42
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Night brought burned guns, thirst, and a house stocked for endurance.",
      "shot": 12,
      "at": 86.375,
      "seconds": 5.5
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I urged the curate to eat, choosing companionship over my former isolation.",
      "shot": 14,
      "at": 96.708,
      "seconds": 5.25
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "It can’t be midnight yet.",
      "shot": 15,
      "at": 105.167,
      "seconds": 1.81
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Glass clashed, masonry fell all about us, and the ceiling came down upon our heads.",
      "shot": 16,
      "at": 110.208,
      "seconds": 6.2
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The blow stunned me; the curate answered injury with water and care.",
      "shot": 17,
      "at": 118.417,
      "seconds": 4.84
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "A metallic rattle made the buried room listen for an unseen visitor.",
      "shot": 18,
      "at": 125.958,
      "seconds": 4.25
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "curate",
      "text": "A Martian!",
      "shot": 19,
      "at": 133.417,
      "seconds": 1.26
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "At dawn, the opening showed the house buried beneath soil, brick, and ruin.",
      "shot": 20,
      "at": 138.708,
      "seconds": 5.56
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "curate",
      "text": "God have mercy upon us!",
      "shot": 21,
      "at": 146.292,
      "seconds": 2.81
    }
  ],
  "plan": "8e8b79851c716a2a"
}